<title>UK: CSFB sets $35 million FTSE Eurotop 100 linked bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets $35 million FTSE Eurotop 100 linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it has issued for itself a $35 million three-year bond whose redemption value is linked to the FTSE Eurotop 100 index.</p>
<p>There are no coupon payments throughout the life of the bond and it has a minimum indicative guaranteed redemption of 107 percent.</p>
<p>The issue price was par and there is a payment date of June 27, 1997. The maturity date is June 27, 2000.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
